# 8. SELECT Statement

Used to retrieve data from a table.

## Select All Columns

```sql
SELECT *
FROM employees;
```

## Select Specific Columns

```sql
SELECT name, salary
FROM employees;
```

## Column Aliases

```sql
SELECT
    name AS employee_name,
    salary AS monthly_salary
FROM employees;
```

## Calculated Columns

```sql
SELECT
    name,
    salary,
    salary * 12 AS annual_salary
FROM employees;
```

Remember: `*` retrieves all columns. In production queries, selecting only required columns is often better.

