# 10. SQL Operators

## Comparison Operators

| Operator | Meaning |
|---|---|
| = | Equal |
| != or <> | Not equal |
| > | Greater than |
| < | Less than |
| >= | Greater than or equal |
| <= | Less than or equal |

## BETWEEN

```sql
SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE salary BETWEEN 15000 AND 22000;
```

BETWEEN includes both boundary values.

## IN

```sql
SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE department IN ('IT', 'HR');
```

## NOT IN

```sql
SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE department NOT IN ('IT', 'HR');
```

## LIKE

Used for pattern matching.

```sql
