FROM employees
WHERE name LIKE 'A%';
```

Common patterns:

| Pattern | Meaning |
|---|---|
| 'A%' | Starts with A |
| '%A' | Ends with A |
| '%A%' | Contains A |
| '_A%' | Second character is A |

